description: Build, check, test, and package multi-platform apps using the tinyjump runtime (.tj files, durable @server objects, Web/Android/iOS/macOS/Linux builds).
globs:
  - "**/*.tj"
  - "**/permissions.json"
  - "**/locales/*.json"
  - "**/tests/*.trace.jsonl"
alwaysApply: false
